13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442980 1075 #edb/ref 17592186442964 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442980 1075 #edb/ref 17592186442969 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442980 1075 #edb/ref 17592186442974 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442980 1075 #edb/ref 17592186442975 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442980 1075 #edb/ref 17592186442977 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442980 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442980 1077 "selection" 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442980 1078 #edb/ref 17592186442977 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442980 1079 #uuid "817f92e5-c306-5bc0-98bb-5216ce23f4dd" 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442981 1075 #edb/ref 17592186442967 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442981 1075 #edb/ref 17592186442968 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442981 1075 #edb/ref 17592186442970 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442981 1075 #edb/ref 17592186442976 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442981 1075 #edb/ref 17592186442978 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442981 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442981 1077 "selection" 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442981 1078 #edb/ref 17592186442967 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442981 1079 #uuid "c7e90ddb-8e9f-5cb4-bec1-a99d63f38772" 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442982 1068 #edb/ref 17592186442980 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442982 1069 "q-108369" 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442982 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442982 1071 "Find the intersection point of the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ with equations\n\n$$\nl:r=⟨-2,1,4⟩+t⟨3,2,-6⟩,\\,Π:-4x+3y-z-11=0.\n$$" 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442982 1072 #uuid "2968eff5-6f3b-5cf4-97d0-686663582eb3" 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442982 1074 "Let's start by writing the equation of the line as\n\n$$\nr=⟨-2+3t,1+2t,4-6t⟩.\n$$\n\nLet's also write the equation of the plane in the dot product form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4x+3y-z-11 & =0 \\\\ -4x+3y-z & =11 \\\\ ⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨-4,3,-1⟩ & =11 \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-4,3,-1⟩ & =11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, substituting $r=⟨-2+3t,1+2t,4-6t⟩$ into the equation of the plane, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot ⟨-4,3,-1⟩ & =11 \\\\ ⟨-2+3t,1+2t,4-6t⟩\\cdot ⟨-4,3,-1⟩ & =11 \\\\ -4(-2+3t)+3(1+2t)-(4-6t) & =11 \\\\ 8-12t+3+6t-4+6t & =11 \\\\ 7 & =11.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation has no solution. Therefore, we conclude that the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ do not intersect." 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442983 1068 #edb/ref 17592186442981 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442983 1069 "q-108308" 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442983 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442983 1071 "Find the intersection point of the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ with equations\n\n$$\nl:r=⟨-1,2,1⟩+t⟨3,0,2⟩,\\,Π:r\\cdot ⟨1,-1,2⟩=13.\n$$" 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442983 1072 #uuid "8e5d0c94-6cbf-5053-b8da-ce1333f1257b" 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442983 1074 "Let's write the equation of the line as\n\n$$\nr=⟨-1+3t,2,1+2t⟩.\n$$\n\nNow, substituting $r=⟨-1+3t,2,1+2t⟩$ into the equation of the plane, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot ⟨1,-1,2⟩ & =13 \\\\ ⟨-1+3t,2,1+2t⟩\\cdot ⟨1,-1,2⟩ & =13 \\\\ 1(-1+3t)-2+2(1+2t) & =13 \\\\ -1+3t-2+2+4t & =13 \\\\ 7t & =14 \\\\ t & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, position vector $p$ of the intersection point $P$ is obtained by substituting $t=2$ into the equation of the line, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p & =⟨-1+3(2),2,1+2(2)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨5,2,5⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the intersection point is $P(5,2,5).$" 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442984 1068 #edb/ref 17592186442979 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442984 1069 "q-108315" 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442984 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442984 1071 "Find the intersection point of the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ with equations\n\n$$\nl:r=⟨1,-3,4⟩+t⟨4,-2,1⟩,\\,Π:r\\cdot ⟨-2,-3,2⟩=1.\n$$" 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442984 1072 #uuid "a985335b-cba4-5e25-b462-ecfeb2395155" 13194139534895 17592186045417 true] [17592186442984 1074 "Let's write the equation of the line as\n\n$$\nr=⟨1+4t,-3-2t,4+t⟩.\n$$\n\nNow, substituting $r=⟨1+4t,-3-2t,4+t⟩$ into the equation of the plane, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot ⟨-2,-3,2⟩ & =1 \\\\ ⟨1+4t,-3-2t,4+t⟩\\cdot ⟨-2,-3,2⟩ & =1 \\\\ -2(1+4t)+(-3)(-3-2t)+2\\cdot (4+t) & =1 \\\\ -2-8t+9+6t+8+2t & =1 \\\\ 15 & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation has no solution. Therefore, we conclude that the line $l$ and the plane $Π$ do not intersect." 13194139534895 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-00128b0b-75f1-5ff4-8a3e-54c15cf052dd" 17592186442960 "answer-0db1cb8d-ae91-58aa-ba6d-996ec7b29ea2" 17592186442961 "answer-25dfd479-4874-55fc-ac79-5aafbe7a30f4" 17592186442962 "answer-266afbbe-3a5e-5405-b0ca-02646080f267" 17592186442963 "answer-613bfe5f-02e2-5735-9f79-164b162ce348" 17592186442964 "answer-66855eaf-d25e-59dd-8568-e9296afde634" 17592186442965 "answer-676389da-d8bf-5b92-bcd7-a398a98b3965" 17592186442966 "answer-8834e13a-22fa-5aac-a999-328918db52aa" 17592186442967 "answer-96d49a2f-474b-5bba-b6c4-17e8726cbd43" 17592186442968 "answer-a6b4a532-3b78-5ed1-a6e7-746b7ec7ab3f" 17592186442969 "answer-b83d1b54-86e9-5e63-af2b-8d6d7fdb32d1" 17592186442970 "answer-bc96ece3-ea6d-5cb5-94a3-9ae65aed87a5" 17592186442971 "answer-c7bcd1a1-4127-5759-8dbc-c749468c35cb" 17592186442972 "answer-cfddec79-fecc-5697-9dc1-640959c5e5fc" 17592186442973 "answer-d748dd3f-d487-5117-bef8-07f995fa3631" 17592186442974 "answer-de970a68-1f18-57df-a82c-3fb7858ebc0a" 17592186442975 "answer